        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Savage, Ozzie Newsome\n- Organizations: Baltimore Ravens, Cleveland Browns, Pro Football Hall of Fame, College Football Hall of Fame\n- Roles: Director of Player Personnel, General Manager, tight end\n\nFacts:\n- Ozzie Newsome Jr. was born on March 16, 1956.\n- Ozzie Newsome played tight end for the Cleveland Browns.\n- Ozzie Newsome was inducted into the College Football Hall of Fame in 1994.\n- Ozzie Newsome was inducted into the Pro Football Hall of Fame in 1999.\n- From 2003 to 2004, Phil Savage served as Director of Player Personnel for the Baltimore Ravens under General Manager Ozzie Newsome.\n- Ozzie Newsome is the general manager of the Baltimore Ravens.",
